# Frame selection by timing.  Each tick adds (vtime - previous tick's vtime) to the playback clock last_frame_ts
# and shows the newest queued frame whose timestamp is <= that clock (older ones are dropped); if no frame is due
# the previous frame stays (cur=-).  Timestamps in ns.
kind cam input asyncvideo
create c cam C
video c bgra 2 2 1000000000 1 1 0
video c bgra 2 2 1033333333 1 2 0
video c bgra 2 2 1066666666 1 3 0
vtime 5000000000
tick c 0.016
astate c
vtime 5016666666
tick c 0.016
astate c
vtime 5033333333
tick c 0.016
astate c
vtime 5050000000
tick c 0.016
astate c
vtime 5066666666
tick c 0.016
astate c
vtime 5083333333
tick c 0.016
astate c
